	$U (P)_{\mathsf{A}\mathsf{B}''} U^\dagger = (P)_{\mathsf{A}\mathsf{A}'}$
	entrywise; the norm identities follow by unitary invariance. The
	homomorphism and commutation properties are read off from the expression
	of each placement as a reindexed tensor factor of the bipartitions of
	Definition~\ref{def:symmetric-equivalents}.
\end{proof}

